Project: UNKNOWN. FastAPI backend, BM25 + FAISS hybrid RAG, web frontend.

The accuracy engine (A1-A9) is built. Reuse compute\_confidence(), build\_sources()

and the AnswerResponse contract. Never duplicate them.

Rules:

1\. Work ONLY on the task I give. No extra files or tests I did not ask for.

2\. Read the relevant code first and summarize it in 5 lines.

3\. No stubs or mocks in production code. Mocks only in tests/.

4\. Never fabricate content; no evidence means "Not found in available sources."

5\. Run only: pytest -q -m "not slow" --timeout=120. Paste the real output.

6\. Do not run live-network or model-download tests.

7\. Do not commit. Show git diff --stat.

8\. If a command hangs over 2 minutes, stop and tell me. Do not retry silently.

9\. Detect the frontend framework from the repo; do not add a second one.

10\. Say "done" only if every ACCEPT check passed. List any that did not.

